 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In twelve seventy-four,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.437
  },
  {
   "text": "samurai rode out to fight an invading army.",
   "s": 1.63,
   "e": 4.167
  },
  {
   "text": "And the army threw thunder at them.",
   "s": 4.549,
   "e": 6.475
  },
  {
   "text": "The Mongol fleet had landed at Hakata Bay,",
   "s": 7.1,
   "e": 9.401
  },
  {
   "text": "in southern Japan.",
   "s": 9.591,
   "e": 10.525
  },
  {
   "text": "A samurai rode forward,",
   "s": 11.023,
   "e": 12.421
  },
  {
   "text": "alone,",
   "s": 12.691,
   "e": 13.139
  },
  {
   "text": "and shouted his name,",
   "s": 13.426,
   "e": 14.559
  },
  {
   "text": "his father's name,",
   "s": 14.791,
   "e": 15.716
  },
  {
   "text": "and all his greatest victories.",
   "s": 15.909,
   "e": 17.675
  },
  {
   "text": "That's how battles started in Japan.",
   "s": 18.039,
   "e": 19.983
  },
  {
   "text": "Then one brave enemy would step out for a duel.",
   "s": 20.425,
   "e": 23.457
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody stepped out.",
   "s": 23.966,
   "e": 25.076
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead,",
   "s": 25.541,
   "e": 26.081
  },
  {
   "text": "the whole Mongol line laughed,",
   "s": 26.34,
   "e": 28.159
  },
  {
   "text": "and fired a thousand arrows at once.",
   "s": 28.325,
   "e": 30.431
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they threw something new.",
   "s": 30.837,
   "e": 32.297
  },
  {
   "text": "A heavy iron ball,",
   "s": 32.712,
   "e": 34.104
  },
  {
   "text": "hissing smoke.",
   "s": 34.389,
   "e": 35.275
  },
  {
   "text": "It bounced once,",
   "s": 35.695,
   "e": 36.671
  },
  {
   "text": "and exploded with a bang so loud,",
   "s": 36.809,
   "e": 38.979
  },
  {
   "text": "horses threw their riders.",
   "s": 39.157,
   "e": 40.761
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 41.204,
   "e": 41.613
  },
  {
   "text": "the balls were hollow,",
   "s": 41.812,
   "e": 42.903
  },
  {
   "text": "packed with gunpowder, and lit with a burning fuse.",
   "s": 43.193,
   "e": 45.953
  },
  {
   "text": "Japan had never seen anything like it.",
   "s": 46.382,
   "e": 48.641
  },
  {
   "text": "That night,",
   "s": 49.11,
   "e": 49.639
  },
  {
   "text": "the invaders sailed away.",
   "s": 49.952,
   "e": 51.252
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven years later,",
   "s": 51.806,
   "e": 52.795
  },
  {
   "text": "they came back with a far bigger fleet.",
   "s": 52.961,
   "e": 55.059
  },
  {
   "text": "But this time,",
   "s": 55.472,
   "e": 56.157
  },
  {
   "text": "a typhoon smashed their ships in the bay.",
   "s": 56.339,
   "e": 58.622
  },
  {
   "text": "The samurai had no answer to thunder.",
   "s": 59.141,
   "e": 61.218
  },
  {
   "text": "So the sky sent its own.",
   "s": 61.693,
   "e": 63.272
  }
 ]
